OL,3,ASoho House venue under investigation
OL,4,Afor food safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA venue of private members club Soho
OL,7,FHouse is being investigated by the
OL,8,Flocal council after a former member of
OL,9,Fstaff raised concerns about out-of-date
OL,10,Ffood allegedly being served.
OL,12,FThe former staff member told BBC News
OL,13,Fhe was pressured to replace labels on
OL,14,Fprepared food if it was not sold at the
OL,15,Fend of the day.
OL,17,FHis contract was terminated two months
OL,18,Fafter he first raised concerns, but
OL,19,FSoho House said this was unrelated to
OL,20,Fhis complaints.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
